<header><p class="enc-kicker">Institution</p><h1 class="enc-title">French Union</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates"><a href="/years/1946">1946</a></span> · <a href="/centuries/20th-century">20th century</a></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">The French Union was the political structure created in 1946 to replace the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/french-colonial-empire">French colonial empire</a>, theoretically making colonial subjects citizens with representation in <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/paris">Paris</a>. It was applied inconsistently, satisfied few, and was replaced by the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/french-community">French Community</a> in 1958.</p><figure class="enc-fig"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/french-union.jpg" alt="French Union" width="320" height="214" fetchpriority="high"><figcaption>Image: Original: Unknown Vector: SKopp · Public domain · <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Flag_of_France.svg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wikimedia Commons</a></figcaption></figure></div>
